(Bayes odds) Tj T*
(Prior odds for A are P\(A\) / P\(not A\), when both probabilities are positive.) Tj T*
(The likelihood ratio of evidence E is P\(E | A\) / P\(E | not A\).) Tj T*
(Posterior odds equal prior odds multiplied by the likelihood ratio.) Tj T*
(Proof: divide the two Bayes formulas and cancel the common P\(E\).) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
